{"logId": "a97c66d8-d410-41e7-a4a7-32a32025783f", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——爱情", "block_bbox": [171, 141, 461, 172], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[171.0, 141.0], [461.0, 141.0], [461.0, 172.0], [171.0, 172.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、双方都是自由的，可以自由地选择在一起或选择分开，若一方提出分手或离婚，另一方会尊重并祝福", "block_bbox": [183, 216, 1005, 239], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 216.0], [1005.0, 216.0], [1005.0, 239.0], [183.0, 239.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、理性地处理感情中的问题，对于不能改变的事情，尽最大努力的往美好地方向上去走", "block_bbox": [183, 246, 883, 269], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 246.0], [883.0, 246.0], [883.0, 269.0], [183.0, 269.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、离开对方，也能很快调整状态、活得灿烂", "block_bbox": [184, 277, 542, 300], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[184.0, 277.0], [542.0, 277.0], [542.0, 300.0], [184.0, 300.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "- 不符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [166, 346, 301, 369], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[166.0, 346.0], [300.0, 346.0], [300.0, 368.0], [166.0, 368.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、过度依赖在对方身上、没有自我，造成对方担负责任", "block_bbox": [180, 386, 632, 409], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[180.0, 386.0], [632.0, 386.0], [632.0, 409.0], [180.0, 409.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、用孩子、父母、家庭等因素情感绑架，要求对方妥协或退让", "block_bbox": [181, 416, 682, 440], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[181.0, 416.0], [682.0, 416.0], [682.0, 440.0], [181.0, 440.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、将个人意愿强加于对方，要求对方必须为自己而改变", "block_bbox": [181, 448, 632, 471], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[181.0, 448.0], [632.0, 448.0], [632.0, 471.0], [181.0, 471.0]]}, {"block_label": "figure_title", "block_content": "[30]", "block_bbox": [574, 716, 611, 738], "block_id": 8, "block_order": null, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[574.0, 716.0], [610.0, 716.0], [610.0, 737.0], [574.0, 737.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——爱情", "block_bbox": [205, 900, 497, 932], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[211.0, 900.0], [496.0, 900.0], [496.0, 931.0], [211.0, 931.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "四级【3~4分】：始终享受爱情、浪漫甜蜜的状态。拥有真诚、信任、相互理解、相互关爱的习惯，因为喜欢而主动创造和享受两个人的生活时光。（甜蜜）", "block_bbox": [199, 976, 1046, 1035], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 976.0], [1046.0, 976.0], [1046.0, 1035.0], [199.0, 1035.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：爱情没有随着时间流逝而减弱或变质，而是始终保持着浪漫、甜蜜的属性。在日常生活中，伴侣/夫妻之间始终保持着爱情的心动和热情，能够主动创造二人空间，注重保持爱情的生命力。且拥有彼此真诚、信任，相互理解、关爱的习惯，相互给予支撑和力量！因为喜欢而主动、热情、持续地创造和享受感情生活的美好。", "block_bbox": [199, 1059, 1051, 1175], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 1059.0], [1051.0, 1059.0], [1051.0, 1175.0], [199.0, 1175.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [201, 1219, 319, 1241], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 1219.0], [318.0, 1219.0], [318.0, 1240.0], [201.0, 1240.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、家庭角色次序：伴侣第一，孩子、父母等其次", "block_bbox": [218, 1258, 613, 1282], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1258.0], [613.0, 1258.0], [613.0, 1282.0], [218.0, 1282.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、保护对方身上最美好纯真的品质，让对方自由自在地活出真实的自己", "block_bbox": [216, 1289, 791, 1312], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[216.0, 1289.0], [791.0, 1289.0], [791.0, 1312.0], [216.0, 1312.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、尊重彼此的个性和兴趣爱好，相互独立、相互成就", "block_bbox": [216, 1320, 650, 1343], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[222.0, 1319.9998779296875], [648.9999389648438, 1319.9998779296875], [648.9999389648438, 1341.9998779296875], [222.0, 1341.9998779296875]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、除孩子、家庭日常外，彼此之间有其他共同话题或兴趣爱好", "block_bbox": [218, 1350, 721, 1373], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1350.0], [721.0, 1350.0], [721.0, 1373.0], [218.0, 1373.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、拥有单独的二人相处时光，有常态化的旅行", "block_bbox": [219, 1381, 596, 1404], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1381.0], [596.0, 1381.0], [596.0, 1404.0], [219.0, 1404.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[31]", "block_bbox": [611, 1477, 650, 1497], "block_id": 18, "block_order": null, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[611.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1496.0], [611.0, 1496.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.825108528137207, "coordinate": [171, 141, 461, 172], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[171.0, 141.0], [461.0, 141.0], [461.0, 172.0], [171.0, 172.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8252668380737305, "coordinate": [183, 216, 1005, 239], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[183.0, 216.0], [1005.0, 216.0], [1005.0, 239.0], [183.0, 239.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text",